The bookmarks bar isn’t visible yet, so before we can create a “Favorites” folder on it, we need to show (toggle) the bar. The quickest way is the Ctrl+Shift+B shortcut.

```python
import pyautogui, time

# Toggle the bookmarks bar
pyautogui.hotkey('ctrl', 'shift', 'b')
time.sleep(0.5)
```
