The bookmarks bar is now visible. To create a new “Favorites” folder, I’ll right-click on an empty spot in the bar and then select “Add folder…” from the context menu.

```python
import pyautogui, time

# Right-click on an empty area of the bookmarks bar
pyautogui.click(300, 150, button='right')
time.sleep(0.5)

# Click the "Add folder..." entry in the context menu
pyautogui.click(300, 210)
time.sleep(0.5)
```
